# The :rbf/:idw environment. This Manifest PINS Surrogates v8.0.0, and the pin
# is load-bearing: resolving fresh against test/ml's stale Zygote/QuasiMonteCarlo
# pins silently yields v6.10.0, whose InverseDistanceSurrogate returns NaN at
# sample-coincident query points. Without this file a clone is not reproducible.
!test/ml/baselines/baseline_env/Manifest.toml

